@urlProduct = http://localhost:5074/api/v1/product
@urlCustomer = http://localhost:5074/api/v1/customer


### GetCustomers
GET {{urlCustomer}}

### GetCustomer
GET {{urlCustomer}}/1

### Delete Customer
DELETE  {{urlCustomer}}/1

### PostCustomer
POST {{urlCustomer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Name": "Pascabowo",
    "Email": "pascabowo@mail.com",
    "Phone": "62888994033",
    "Address": "jl. acropolis cibubur kab. bogor"
}

### GetProducts
GET {{urlProduct}}

### GetProductsActive
GET {{urlProduct}}?activaOnly=true

### GetProduct
GET {{urlProduct}}/PR02

### PostProduct
POST {{urlProduct}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "productCode": "PR04",
    "name": "Buku",
    "price": 50000.00,
    "stock": 100,
    "category": "Pendidikan",
    "description": "buku merupakan sebuah alat untuk mengetik dengan teknologi zaman modern"
}

### Put-Product
PUT {{urlProduct}}/PR13
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Keyboard",
    "price": 200040.00,
    "stock": 40,
    "category": "Elektrik"
}

### Delete Product
DELETE  {{urlProduct}}/pr99

### Nonaktifkan produk
PATCH {{urlProduct}}/PR01/deactivate

### Aktifkan produk
PATCH {{urlProduct}}/PR01/activate

### Upload Gambar
POST http://localhost:5074/api/v1/product/PR02/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=KodaStore

--KodaStore
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="valid_product.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/rifdev/Documents/valid_product.jpeg

--KodaStore--
